---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="论文" description="Yan Zeng 的公开论文信息。" lang="zh" pageKey="papers">
  <div class="page">
    <header class="page-title">
      <p class="eyebrow">论文</p>
      <h1>论文</h1>
      <p>进行中的论文与公开论文信息。预印本只会在确认可以公开流通后加入。</p>
    </header>

    <section class="section-grid" aria-label="论文列表">
      <article class="panel">
        <h3>Unfair Role-Burden Allocation and the Structure of AI Trust</h3>
        <p class="muted">手稿进行中。</p>
        <p>发展一种结构性 AI 信任理论，核心是人类-AI 依赖关系中的公平角色分配。</p>
      </article>
      <article class="panel">
        <h3>Collective Forgiveness as a Thin Practical-Normative Act</h3>
        <p class="muted">手稿进行中。</p>
        <p>回应 group-mind 异议，辩护一种薄的实践性集体宽恕理论。</p>
      </article>
      <article class="panel">
        <h3>Simplicity and Complexity in Philosophy and Science</h3>
        <p class="muted">课程论文 / 进行中。</p>
        <p>把简单性和复杂性理解为探究中的互补方法论原则。</p>
      </article>
      <article class="panel">
        <h3>Hume on Miracles, Testimony, and Evidential Proportionality</h3>
        <p class="muted">课程论文。</p>
        <p>通过 testimony、evidential proportionality 和 comparative probability 重构 Hume 的 “Of Miracles”。</p>
      </article>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
